\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide ext-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-e121f3d3 wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card ext-card-stacked-icon is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--item-card-1--align-start is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b6b47c84 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--item-card-1--align-start--13\" style=\"min-height:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card-content wp-container-content-ceb7f5b3 is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b6b47c84 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card-body is-layout-flow wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c00cb370 wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large ext-aspect-landscape extendify-image-import ext-card-icon is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--icon-1 wp-duotone-foreground-and-background is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--icon-1--14\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">Lead Instructor<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-foreground-alt-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\">Dedicated to helping students master the fretboard with personalized scheduling and lessons.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card ext-card-stacked-icon is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--item-card-1--align-start is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b6b47c84 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--item-card-1--align-start--15\" style=\"min-height:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card-content wp-container-content-ceb7f5b3 is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b6b47c84 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card-body is-layout-flow wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c00cb370 wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large ext-aspect-landscape extendify-image-import ext-card-icon is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--icon-1 wp-duotone-foreground-and-background is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--icon-1--16\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">Acoustic Specialist<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-foreground-alt-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\">Focuses on fingerstyle techniques and music theory to build a strong foundation.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card ext-card-stacked-icon is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--item-card-1--align-start is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b6b47c84 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--item-card-1--align-start--17\" style=\"min-height:100%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card-content wp-container-content-ceb7f5b3 is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-b6b47c84 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-card-body is-layout-flow wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c00cb370 wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large ext-aspect-landscape extendify-image-import ext-card-icon is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--icon-1 wp-duotone-foreground-and-background is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--icon-1--18\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,\" alt=\"\" style=\"object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\">Rock and Blues Coach<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-foreground-alt-color has-text-color wp-block-paragraph\">Brings years of stage experience to help aspiring guitarists develop their unique sound.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section ext-section has-background-background-color has-background has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section--19\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-d96dcb9d wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--image-1--content-right ext-animate--on extendify-image-import is-style-ext-preset--image--natural-1--image-1--content-right--20\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/images.unsplash.com\/photo-1745852738156-3a5f2478ef35?orientation=landscape?fit=crop&#038;crop=entropy%2Cfaces&#038;auto=format%2Ccompress&#038;w=1280\" alt=\"\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group ext-section-intro is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section-intro-1 has-custom-css has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained is-style-ext-preset--group--natural-1--section-intro-1--21 wp-custom-css-825ebbf4\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading ext-animate--on\">Meet Our Expert Guitar Instructors<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"ext-animate--on has-foregro